· (A1): satisfied whenever $\eta \not\equiv 0$.
· (A2′): satisfied by the soft-rewrite with $\beta > 0$; Lipschitz constant $L_{\mathrm{TV}} = O(1/\beta)$.
· (A3): rate matching by MDL.
